    "body": "Thanks for reporting this. like what you pointed out in the Chromium implementation,I suspect [web-bluetooth/scanning.bs](https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth/blob/f3b31870764ce76fa1fa671f7bcdac7944a246a0/scanning.bs#L419-L426) should just use `BluetoothLEScanFilterInit` from [web-bluetooth/index.bs](https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth/blob/f3b31870764ce76fa1fa671f7bcdac7944a246a0/index.bs#L529-L535). We will look into this and update this when we are actively working on shipping Web Bluetooth Scanning.",
